/*
 * uma_s7test.c - LX_UMA Phase 0 test 0.0b (docs/port-plan.md): does the bootloader erase flash sector 7?
 *
 * The Eurorack's bootloader doesn't erase sector 7 (0x080C0000-0x080FFFFF), so its firmware must end below
 * 0x080C0000 (736 KB). This build puts a 4 KB pattern at the start of sector 7 (section .uma_s7test, placed by
 * STM32F765VGTX_FLASH.ld) and checks it at start-up. 0.0b writes the pattern, 0.0b2 its inverse: programming
 * the inverse over the pattern turns 0 bits into 1, which only works on erased flash. If both install and both
 * show "S7 ok", the bootloader erases sector 7 and the firmware may use all 992 KB.
 */
